---
title: Seven cumulative responsibilities
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: GKOS layer responsibilities and governing records
    accDescr: Original Sources produce a Source Record, Structure and Identity a Structured Knowledge Object, and Relationships and Lineage assertion and lineage records. Validation and Control produces diagnostics and control receipts, Review and Workflow a Decision Record, Context Presentation a Context Manifest, and Authorized Use an Authorized Use Record. These cumulative responsibilities are grouped into knowledge substrate, decision and control, and governance envelope; they are not a mandatory synchronous pipeline.
    subgraph GOV["Governance envelope"]
        L7["L7 Authorized Use<br/>Authorized Use Record"]
        L6["L6 Context Presentation<br/>Context Manifest"]
    end
    subgraph REASON["Decision and control"]
        L5["L5 Review and Workflow<br/>Decision Record"]
        L4["L4 Validation and Control<br/>Diagnostics and control receipts"]
    end
    subgraph KNOW["Knowledge substrate"]
        L3["L3 Relationships and Lineage<br/>Assertion and lineage records"]
        L2["L2 Structure and Identity<br/>Structured Knowledge Object"]
        L1["L1 Original Sources<br/>Source Record"]
    end
    L1 --> L2 --> L3 --> L4 --> L5 --> L6 --> L7

